Package: RBee
Title: Retinoblastoma Classification Using DNA Methylation Array Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Stefanie", "Volz",
           email = "stefanie.volz@kitz-heidelberg.de",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: RBee (RetinoBlastoma boosted ensemble estimator)
    provides a pretrained XGBoost classifier for molecular
    classification of retinoblastoma using DNA methylation array
    beta values. The classifier distinguishes three retinoblastoma
    molecular subgroups (Subtype 1, Subtype 2 Cluster B, and
    Subtype 2 Cluster C), normal retina, and ocular disease
    controls. It accepts preprocessed methylation beta matrices
    derived from tumor tissue or aqueous humor liquid biopsies
    and returns predicted classes and class probabilities.
    The classifier was trained using Noob-normalized methylation
    array data. DNA methylation preprocessing is not performed
    by the package.
